# MVCS architecture

Business logic belongs in Services. Controllers stay thin: authenticate, authorize, validate, call a service, return a result. Views render prepared data and must not query Prisma or encode domain state transitions.

Dependency direction:

```text
View → Controller → Service → Repository / Model / Database
```

Account roles (USER, RAID_LEAD, ADMIN) are not booster/lootbuddy identities. BOOSTER and LOOTBUDDY are run participation types. Booster eligibility is granular by class, role, and difficulty. Character lockouts are scoped to character + raid + difficulty + reset.
